#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:3
msgid "Tutorial: Notifications"
msgstr "Tutorial: notifikationer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:7
msgid "This tutorial explains:"
msgstr "Denne tutorial forklarer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:10
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"The notification system was introduced with the release of phpBB "
":guilabel:`3.1`. Since then it has seen further developments and "
"enhancements for users and extension developers. In :guilabel:`3.2` the "
"notification system was heavily refactored making it faster and more "
"efficient."
msgstr ""
"Notifikationssystemet blev introduceret med udgivelsen af phpBB "
":guilabel:`3.1`. Siden da har det gennemgået yderligere udvikling og "
"forbedringer for brugere og udvidelsesudviklere. I :guilabel:`3.2` blev "
"notifikationssystemet kraftigt refaktoreret, hvilket gjorde det hurtigere og"
" mere effektivt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:15
msgid ""
"phpBB users have complete control over their personal notification "
"interactions. They can set their own preferences for notification methods or"
" disable them all together. Mark notifications as read when necessary, even "
"though in a lot of cases this is done automatically."
msgstr ""
"phpBB-brugere har fuld kontrol over deres personlige "
"notifikationsinteraktioner. De kan sætte deres egne præferencer for "
"notifikationsmetoder eller deaktivere dem helt. Markere notifikationer som "
"læst efter behov, selvom dette i mange tilfælde sker automatisk."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:19
msgid ""
"In phpBB there are two default notification methods: email-based and board-"
"based notifications. The email method is only available when the ''board-"
"wide emails'' setting has been enabled by the board administrator in the "
"ACP. Extensions, however, can create and add their own notification methods."
msgstr ""
"I phpBB findes der to standardnotifikationsmetoder: e-mailbaserede og "
"forumbaserede notifikationer. E-mailmetoden er kun tilgængelig, når "
"indstillingen ''board-wide emails'' er aktiveret af forumadministratoren i "
"ACP. Udvidelser kan dog oprette og tilføje deres egne notifikationsmetoder."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:23
msgid ""
"This tutorial will document how and extension can leverage the notification "
"system by creating a notification based on some sort of triggering event "
"(such as replying to a post), sending the notification via either the board,"
" email or some other custom methods, and managing its notifications."
msgstr ""
"Denne tutorial vil dokumentere, hvordan en udvidelse kan gøre brug af "
"notifikationssystemet ved at oprette en notifikation baseret på en form for "
"udløsende event (såsom at svare på et indlæg), sende notifikationen via "
"enten forummet, e-mail eller andre brugerdefinerede metoder, og administrere"
" sine notifikationer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:29
msgid "File Structure"
msgstr "Filstruktur"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_notifications.rst:30
msgid ""
"This is an overview of the file structure needed for a notification to "
"function within an extension. In total there are 7 files that will be "
"covered in this tutorial, to create and send notifications. These files will"
" be referenced throughout this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Dette er en oversigt over den filstruktur, der er nødvendig for, at en "
"notifikation kan fungere i en udvidelse. I alt er der 7 filer, der vil blive"
" gennemgået i denne tutorial, til at oprette og sende notifikationer. Der "
"refereres til disse filer gennem hele tutorialen."

